    "title": "Bilinear cannot serve as the base of a lazy module with unknown input widths",
    "body": "Constructing a lazy Bilinear subclass with zero placeholders for its two unknown input widths raises before the subclass can initialize parameters. Lazy construction must be possible until the first inputs establish both widths, while an ordinary torch.nn.Bilinear must still validate initialization and produce its expected output shape.",
